{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act39side_level_act39side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act39side",
  "stageId": "act39side_05",
  "title": "Let the Light of the Past Die",
  "storyCode": "EP-5",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "57f836add43015541c604225726d96e59ee28a568ca3908d3deaba16aceab245",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mmph... mmph!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mmph—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Give it up already, will you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't blame me for handing you over to the Inquisition. We all have to look out for ourselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll take the cloth out of your mouths if you'll quiet down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Nods hesitantly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll be quiet..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah, if you know what's good for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But even if you hand us and the compass over, that doesn't mean things will end well for you. Ever thought about that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The bodies of your dead crewmates are still decorating the flagpole outside of town. You sure you won't end up joining them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No... Not here either..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where is that blasted compass? The chaval puts it back here every night!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is this what you're looking for, Javi?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You shouldn't have come back so soon, Juana."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "On the contrary, I think I returned at precisely the right time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Señora, I... I don't have a choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Put down the knife, Javi. I taught you how to use it. You don't stand a chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're injured. Might not even be hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How did it come to this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What dissatisfaction could possibly have driven you to point your blade at me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I was never unhappy with you. I supported every decision you ever made, every idea you ever had."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When my mother left me, you took my hand and said we were family."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ever since then, I've never been unhappy with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's for your good, Juana... for you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lies. I'm standing right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tell me! How is it my for own good when you're pointing a blade at me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Juana I know wouldn't put the entire fleet in danger for her own selfish desires. She's a brave, wise leader we can trust."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're not her. You're just a..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Spit it out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just a pathetic woman who refuses to face reality, drowning herself in the passions of the past!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I've told you time and again...\nThe ocean is not our past. It's our future."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's what you want to believe. No one else in the fleet does. The old generation is dead. The stories they told should've died with them."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Give me the compass, Juana. Don't make me take it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'd like to see you try."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't you understand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You really think I made the decision to hand it over to the Inquisition on my own?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A mutiny... So this is what was waiting for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What a surprise."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All I want is the compass. All they want is a peaceful future."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Give us what we want, and you can still be our leader. Nothing has to change."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nothing will change? Don't tell me you actually believe that, Javi?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stop fooling yourself. At the very least, I wouldn't trust you like before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hesitant Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry to do this to you, boss, but the sea's no place to call home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hesitant Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We just wanna leave the Flat and live a better life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Put down your weapons, go back to your tents, and I'll pretend none of this happened."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're out of options, mates."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We can't keep fooling ourselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Sorry I'm late."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mmph—! Let go of me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The hell I will, you finshit eater. I still got the marks from the ropes!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hesitant Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You said nobody would know about this mutiny, Javier!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Mierda!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I found Señor Rus 'lost' on the Salt Flat, so I brought him back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hesitant Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's this about, Javier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now now, I wouldn't make any wrong moves if I were you. Not if you still care about your friend here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hesitant Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shut up! This is none of your business, outsider!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do you suggest we do then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "To fight them of course! Burn that blasted town to the ground and take back what's ours!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're going against the boss over some finshit scheme to kneel before the Inquisition? Did you lose your spine like a gutted fin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Teach",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They just killed so many of us and took our supplies, and you can't wait to grovel to them, Javier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Teach",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know Juana taught you better than that."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're tired, wounded, and can barely muster up half a scrap of food. How're we supposed to fight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hesitant Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Besides, those Inquisition capullos wouldn't even be after us if that dumb girl didn't bring the compass here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Er, Señora Juana...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So just give them the girl! What do you think you're doing, turning yourselves in along with her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Teach...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Teach",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Enough, this isn't helping."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hesitant Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah, why haven't we handed her over yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Urk!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Señores and señoras, if I may say something..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You shut your mouth!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Uh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cold sweat runs down Pascuala's back as the pirates point their cutlasses at her.\nShe gulps and tries to wipe her sweaty palms on her pants.\nShe knows there is only ever one way to get what she wants: fight for it with her own two hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come on, guys, what are you doing to one little girl?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Pelirrojito, you—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So many adults in the room, and the best you can come up with is to hand over a child?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Enough already!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, I'm speaking up for you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know! But I can speak for myself!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You folks wanna hand me over? Sure! Why not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I get why you'd want to beat the finshit out of me, and I'm sure you get why I scammed you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Violence and deception. That's how we survive. That's all we know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But you know how they do things in town. Do you really think handing me and the compass over will help you even one bit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But if you don't, the Inquisition bastards will keep hunting you, and that won't go so well for you either, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So what's your point? We're screwed either way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "One week."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Give us one week to fix up that compass!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes. I just need a little more time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
