      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pascuala feels like her heart is about to leap from her chest. Her clothes are soaked with sweat.\nThe room is completely silent. She forces a smile and turns to look at Juana, Teach, Isidro, and Elysium behind her, who answer with approving eyes."
